    "quote": "Visiting Eishin Gakuen Higashino High School, the largest architectural project involving Christopher Alexander, after 15 years, I found that while it has changed little by little, it still presents its charm today. Focusing on the \"pond\" that particularly caught my attention, I have written down my thoughts on the",
